{"id":"n42933-2-7","stage":5,"title":"노화 · 老化","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42933-2-7-1","ko":"고무가 왜 이렇게 딱딱하게 굳었지?","zh":"橡胶怎么变得这么硬了呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고무가","meaning":"橡胶","explanation":"고무：橡胶；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고무","audio":"/audio/ac8961e27de9f4a32e4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20068","senseId":"1","lemma":"고무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고무가","audio":"/audio/85496ec64a79c16ada04.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"딱딱하게","meaning":"硬","explanation":"딱딱하다：硬；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"딱딱하다","audio":"/audio/ba546782d13ea05ba23f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15087","senseId":"1","lemma":"딱딱하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딱딱하게","audio":"/audio/10a804186ef8ecd1fe1e.mp3"}},{"text":"굳었지?","meaning":"变硬","explanation":"굳다：变硬；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"굳다","audio":"/audio/d4ef1d272e8691bbe74f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36860","senseId":"1","lemma":"굳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굳었지","audio":"/audio/2e77153f9171f74d2d88.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac8961e27de9f4a3","term":"고무","zh":"橡胶","audio":"/audio/ac8961e27de9f4a32e4c.mp3","entryId":"20068","definition":"把橡胶树里流出的液体凝固后做成的高弹性的物质。","pronunciation":["고